<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Hermes on Aliya の 笔记</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/tags/hermes/</link><description>Recent content in Hermes on Aliya の 笔记</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 15:45:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/tags/hermes/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>cron 与 heartbeat 实测分工</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/cron-%E4%B8%8E-heartbeat-%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 15:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/cron-%E4%B8%8E-heartbeat-%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-062.jpg" alt="Featured image of post cron 与 heartbeat 实测分工" />heartbeat 插件补的是 cron 做不了的三件事——带上下文的提醒、条件触发、静默后检查。这篇讲清两者边界、正确调用顺序，以及三个容易踩空的失效模式</description></item><item><title>给Hermes和大肥鱼接入代理并使用国外模型</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E7%BB%99hermes%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A5%E9%B1%BC%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:37:16 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E7%BB%99hermes%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A5%E9%B1%BC%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-127.avif" alt="Featured image of post 给Hermes和大肥鱼接入代理并使用国外模型" />想用 Gemini/OpenAI 这类国外模型，国内直连不通，得走代理。但 Hermes 和大肥鱼都是常驻服务，代理只能整服务加、不能按模型单独加。这篇讲清两种接法的代价和具体命令。</description></item></channel></rss>